      "content": "A private place for health information you want close at hand.\n\n## Contacts\n| Who | Phone | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| Doctor | | |\n| Pharmacy | | |\n\n## Medications\n| Name | Dose | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| | | |\n\n## Appointments\n- [ ] Next check-up:\n\n## Log\nDate: notes on how you feel, symptoms, or questions for your next visit.",
