    {
     "key": "starter-note-welcome",
     "value": {
      "id": "starter-note-welcome",
      "title": "Welcome to My Notes",
      "content": "Your notes stay in this browser. Nothing is sent anywhere, and the app works offline.\n\n## Getting around\n- **Libraries, shelves, and notebooks** in the sidebar organize your notes, from broad to specific.\n- **Search** looks through titles, text, notebooks, and tags.\n- **Favorites** and **pins** keep important notes close.\n\n## Writing\nNotes use Markdown: `**bold**`, `*italic*`, `# headings`, and lists. The preview beside the editor shows the result as you type.\n\n- [ ] Tick this box in the preview to try a checklist\n- [ ] Add a tag to this note\n- [ ] Link to another note: type `[[` and pick a title, like [[Weekly plan]]\n\n## Keeping your notes safe\nExport a backup from **Settings** now and then, and keep it somewhere other than this browser.\n\nDelete this note whenever you like.",
      "notebookId": "starter-personal",
      "createdAt": 1768471200000,
      "updatedAt": 1768471200000,
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "favorite": false
     }
